// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x0004DB33 size=67 name=?radarToPixel@W3DRadar@@IAEXPBUICoord2D@@PAU2@HHHH@Z evidence=N:ledger tier=B hypothesis:K
void W3DRadar::radarToPixel(const ICoord2D *radar, ICoord2D *pixel, Int radarUpperLeftX, Int radarUpperLeftY, Int radarWidth, Int radarHeight)
{
	// sanity
	if (radar == NULL || pixel == NULL)
		return;

	// compute pixel location
	pixel->x = (Int)(radar->x * radarWidth / 128 + radarUpperLeftX);
	pixel->y = (Int)((128 - 1 - radar->y) * radarHeight / 128 + radarUpperLeftY);
}

